## Agent priority

Removed in 2.0: an unknown attribute, silenced below.

<!-- smd-disable-next-line attrs/unknown -->
:::agent{priority=high}
Read the cases above before changing how attribute lists are parsed.
:::

## A stray closer

The closing fence below has nothing to close. It keeps `smd fmt` from rewriting the mismatched closers above, so this document stays formatted as written.

<!-- smd-disable-next-line container/stray-close -->
:::
